  "body_html": "<p><em><strong>Updates:</strong></em></p><ul><li><p><em>Feb8’26: <a href=\"https://www.beatingthetide.com/p/the-crown-has-been-passed-powl-powell\">Q1 2026 Earnings Results &amp; revised target price ($400 → $545)</a></em></p></li><li><p><em>Dec10´25: <a href=\"https://www.beatingthetide.com/p/powell-industries-q4-and-full-year-powl\">Q4 2025 Earnings Results</a></em></p></li><li><p><em>Aug10’25: <a href=\"https://www.beatingthetide.com/i/170451644/powell-industries-powl\">Q3 2025 Earnings Results</a></em></p></li><li><p><em>May11’25: <a href=\"https://www.beatingthetide.com/i/163215277/powell-industries-dips-despite-earnings-beat-slower-growth-ahead\">Q2 2025 Earnings Results</a></em></p></li><li><p><em>Feb9’25: <a href=\"https://www.beatingthetide.com/i/156817947/powell-industries-powl-earnings-strong-quarter-weak-market-reaction\">Q1 2025 Earnings Results</a></em></p></li></ul><div><hr></div><p>At the beginning of 2024, I grabbed POWL shares for $80, and they’ve now shot up over three times to $250. I still think there’s plenty of upside left. In this article, I’ll break down why. If you’re into real-time trade alerts for my portfolio, check out the paid memberships. </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatingthetide.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://www.beatingthetide.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p>Or if you think someone would enjoy this, please refer them to my Substack.</p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatingthetide.com/leaderboard?&referrer_token=823wu&amp;utm_source=post&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Refer a friend&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://www.beatingthetide.com/leaderboard?&referrer_token=823wu&amp;utm_source=post\"><span>Refer a friend</span></a></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!kNYm!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdfc2267c-306c-4284-8f44-8c25548ff2e7_648x417.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!kNYm!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdfc2267c-306c-4284-8f44-8c25548ff2e7_648x417.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!kNYm!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdfc2267c-306c-4284-8f44-8c25548ff2e7_648x417.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!kNYm!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdfc2267c-306c-4284-8f44-8c25548ff2e7_648x417.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!kNYm!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdfc2267c-306c-4284-8f44-8c25548ff2e7_648x417.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!kNYm!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdfc2267c-306c-4284-8f44-8c25548ff2e7_648x417.png\" width=\"648\" height=\"417\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/dfc2267c-306c-4284-8f44-8c25548ff2e7_648x417.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:417,&quot;width&